    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jumper\u2019s Doom</strong> is a brutally challenging 2D retro platformer set in a haunting black-and-white world. Take control of the Jumpers and embark on a mission to save a planet drained of all color. Only the legendary Lotus Flower can restore life to this bleak and desolate land. Every jump is a risk. Every mistake means death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784980/extras/7bc4a45e859d6a3fe9af0ec7b5286db8.avif?t=1753904630\" data-has-big width=800 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a real test of skill: deadly traps, tight platforming, and unforgiving level design. Unlock unique characters, each with their own visual style, and dive into local co-op mode. Play on the same screen with a friend or blame them after your hundredth death. This game doesn\u2019t just test your reflexes it tests your nerves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784980/extras/14a4a2bd5563ddf6ea5b58ed066436fe.avif?t=1753904630\" data-has-big width=800 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports resolutions: 1280\u00d7720, 1366\u00d7768, 1280\u00d7800, 1600\u00d7900, 1920\u00d71080, 2560\u00d71440, and 3840\u00d72160</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With stylish pixel art, a grim atmosphere, and relentless pacing, <strong>Jumper\u2019s Doom</strong> is a must-play for fans of hardcore platformers. Jump, fight, die, and try again.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jumper\u2019s Doom</strong> is a brutally challenging 2D retro platformer set in a haunting black-and-white world. Take control of the Jumpers and embark on a mission to save a planet drained of all color. Only the legendary Lotus Flower can restore life to this bleak and desolate land. Every jump is a risk. Every mistake means death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784980/extras/7bc4a45e859d6a3fe9af0ec7b5286db8.avif?t=1753904630\" data-has-big width=800 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a real test of skill: deadly traps, tight platforming, and unforgiving level design. Unlock unique characters, each with their own visual style, and dive into local co-op mode. Play on the same screen with a friend or blame them after your hundredth death. This game doesn\u2019t just test your reflexes it tests your nerves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784980/extras/14a4a2bd5563ddf6ea5b58ed066436fe.avif?t=1753904630\" data-has-big width=800 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports resolutions: 1280\u00d7720, 1366\u00d7768, 1280\u00d7800, 1600\u00d7900, 1920\u00d71080, 2560\u00d71440, and 3840\u00d72160</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With stylish pixel art, a grim atmosphere, and relentless pacing, <strong>Jumper\u2019s Doom</strong> is a must-play for fans of hardcore platformers. Jump, fight, die, and try again.</p>",
    "short_description": "Jumper\u2019s Doom is a challenging 2D platformer with a retro vibe, where every obstacle could be your last. Play solo or in local co-op and restore color to the world as you jump through a dark, black-and-white landscape.",
